## Opening a structure {#opening-a-structure}

Spot a molecular structure file (e.g., .pdb, .cif) on a supported site. A green **Mol\*** badge appears next to the file link or download button.
ffd

{{< figure src="/assets/github_badge.png" class="center-image" width="70%" >}}

1.  Click the badge.
2.  The file opens instantly in the **Mol\*** web viewer in a new tab.

The badge appears automatically—no configuration required. If it doesn’t appear, check the [FAQ]({{< relref "faq" >}}) for troubleshooting steps.
